window.docContents[34].resolve({"/Ch05TypeclassSynthesis/#failure-diamond-problem":{"contents":"症状：找到多个实例无法决定，或多重继承路径不一致。\n\n-- [示意] Diamond problem\nclass A (α : Type)\nclass B (α : Type) extends A α\nclass C (α : Type) extends A α\nclass D (α : Type) extends B α, C α\n-- D → B → A 和 D → C → A 必须 definitionally equal\n\n\n诊断：set_option trace.Meta.synthInstance true 查看完整搜索过程。\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009Type Class Synthesis\u00095.7 常见失败模式","header":"7.8.2. 失败二：实例歧义 / Diamond Problem","id":"/Ch05TypeclassSynthesis/#failure-diamond-problem"},"/Ch08Omega/#ch08-constraint":{"contents":"Constraint 用一对可选的上下界表示约束。v4.32.2 为二者分别提供了 LowerBound、UpperBound 类型别名，字段并不直接写成 Option Int：\n\n-- [Lean 4 v4.32.2, Init/Omega/Constraint.lean:29-32,54-59]\nabbrev LowerBound : Type := Option Int\nabbrev UpperBound : Type := Option Int\n\nstructure Constraint where\n  /-- A lower bound. -/\n  lowerBound : LowerBound\n  /-- An upper bound. -/\n  upperBound : UpperBound\nderiving BEq, DecidableEq, Repr\n\n\n语义是 lowerBound ≤ value ≤ upperBound，none 表示无约束。预定义特殊约束：\n\n-- [Lean 4 v4.32.2, Init/Omega/Constraint.lean:101-106]\ndef trivial : Constraint := ⟨none, none⟩\ndef impossible : Constraint := ⟨some 1, some 0⟩\ndef exact (r : Int) : Constraint := ⟨some r, some r⟩\n\n\n关键操作：\n\n-- [Lean 4 v4.32.2, Init/Omega/Constraint.lean:190-193]\ndef combine (x y : Constraint) : Constraint where\n  lowerBound := Option.merge max x.lowerBound y.lowerBound\n  upperBound := Option.merge min x.upperBound y.upperBound\n\n-- [Lean 4 v4.32.2, Init/Omega/Constraint.lean:182-184]\ndef combo (a : Int) (x : Constraint) (b : Int) (y : Constraint) : Constraint :=\n  add (scale a x) (scale b y)\n\n-- [Lean 4 v4.32.2, Init/Omega/Constraint.lean:115-118]\ndef isImpossible : Constraint → Bool\n  | ⟨some x, some y⟩ => y < x\n  | _ => false\n\n\ncombine 是同系数约束合并的核心——把两个约束取交集（更紧的界）。combo 是 Fourier-Motzkin 消元的基本操作——两个约束的线性组合。\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009omega：Presburger 算术决策过程\u0009核心数据结构","header":"10.3.3. Constraint：约束的上下界","id":"/Ch08Omega/#ch08-constraint"},"/Ch08Omega/#ch08-omega-monad":{"contents":"omega 使用多层 monad 栈管理状态。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009omega：Presburger 算术决策过程","header":"10.7. OmegaM monad","id":"/Ch08Omega/#ch08-omega-monad"},"/Ch11Aesop/#ch11-symptom-safe-aggressive":{"contents":"-- ❌ destruct 消耗假设丢失信息\n-- @\\[aesop safe destruct]\n-- theorem bad : P ∨ Q → True := fun _ => trivial\n-- ✅ 改为 forward 或降级 unsafe\n\n\nSafe 规则有 commit 语义——如果一条更早的 safe 规则先匹配并 commit，后续 safe 规则不会被尝试。调整 penalty 值或将干扰规则改为 unsafe。\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009aesop：可配置的启发式搜索\u0009调试手册\u0009症状 → 诊断 → 修复","header":"13.9.3.4. 症状：safe 规则过度激进","id":"/Ch11Aesop/#ch11-symptom-safe-aggressive"},"/Ch14Positivity/#exercise-14-6":{"contents":"example (x : ℝ) (hx : 2 ≤ x) : 0 < x ^ 2 - x := by\n  sorry\n\n\n提示：positivity 直接失败（减法）。用 have : 0 < x * (x - 1) := by ...\n建立中间事实，或用 nlinarith。\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009positivity：符号非负性推理\u000914.9 练习","header":"16.9.6. 练习 6（进阶）：分段证明","id":"/Ch14Positivity/#exercise-14-6"},"/Ch22ExternalTools/#exercise-encoding-signatures":{"contents":"为以下场景设计类型签名（不需实现）：\n\n-- (a) 把 Prop 目标编码为 SMT-LIB，需要返回变量映射以便解码\n-- def encodeGoalToSMT : ??? := ...\n\n-- (b) 解析 LRAT 证书\n-- def parseLRAT : ??? := ...\n\n\n提示：\n(a) Expr → MetaM (String × HashMap Expr String)\n(b) String → MetaM (List LRATStep)\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009对接外部工具\u000922.11 练习","header":"24.11.3. 练习 3（进阶）：设计编码函数签名","id":"/Ch22ExternalTools/#exercise-encoding-signatures"}});